{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is in need of a warrior, mage, rogue, or any kind of hero that you can build-craft into existence. Pick a class, a weapon and off-hand equip, a passive skill, and your base stats to go slay some gobbos! Your adventure will likely be short-lived, so there will be plenty of chances to experiment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What to expect from this game:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of build customization before you start a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of customization during a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build changes how your character feels to control, jump higher, more control, faster running, base stats make your character truly unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 classes to choose from, each with their own set of abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 weapons to equip, each with their own strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different defensive skills to pick to further customize how your hero deals with problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless passive skills to buy along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of enemy variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of rooms that might be harder or easier due to your build, pick the best ones for maximized gold!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs who (usually) help you out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The effect of your character stats:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many factors  change how your character moves, your stats change how your character controls at a fundamental level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to increased attack power, your Strength also improves your jumping, opening up paths that might be harder to reach for others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility affects your critical hit chance, but also makes you more maneuverable in the air, making it easier to weave through enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More attack speed is great, but your Speed stat also improves your running, truly opening up that option of building a &quot;dashing&quot; rogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not that interested in physical abilities? No worries, mental stats are very powerful when using magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fake hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/267c184c77f1f5755e6d340b0c2f7adfc8bf1600.jpg"},{"name":"True hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/050a09a4b57937a4cd49b04923b2ed8dd811570c.jpg"},{"name":"Blademaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/7547ce4ffe99ed61a96ba6002359841986080315.jpg"},{"name":"Spartan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/b30df24d9b4b78cfe7371ea67d88472ea3743f65.jpg"},{"name":"Lumberjack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/73b6f2c87490c69d3673ca51e1a9703bdee1e16a.jpg"},{"name":"Knife fight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/d9d56bbd892e2e0181c87de2216ea2b69e9afba9.jpg"},{"name":"Bow for me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/8c6f88d5703462dc58310eefc9ae55e420094de4.jpg"},{"name":"Sticker star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/96ae832ee2c59fc16015ff6d7cf323dfd7b9c1a4.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect stick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/06f5cadecaa3f5190b4ac6786e18bf87f17b3520.jpg"},{"name":"Rodmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892290/f40cc5db86f123c2c9db54465124f23d2f3ae099.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892290?t=1761047830","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/9961aae0ece68519a3568ca25a221aec1023cfbf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761047830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/a8ab01fbd8478441eb296f0b843787445692849a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761047830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/a8ab01fbd8478441eb296f0b843787445692849a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761047830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3936820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is in need of a warrior, mage, rogue, or any kind of hero that you can build-craft into existence. Pick a class, a weapon and off-hand equip, a passive skill, and your base stats to go slay some gobbos! Your adventure will likely be short-lived, so there will be plenty of chances to experiment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What to expect from this game:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of build customization before you start a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of customization during a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build changes how your character feels to control, jump higher, more control, faster running, base stats make your character truly unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 classes to choose from, each with their own set of abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 weapons to equip, each with their own strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different defensive skills to pick to further customize how your hero deals with problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless passive skills to buy along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of enemy variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of rooms that might be harder or easier due to your build, pick the best ones for maximized gold!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs who (usually) help you out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The effect of your character stats:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many factors  change how your character moves, your stats change how your character controls at a fundamental level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to increased attack power, your Strength also improves your jumping, opening up paths that might be harder to reach for others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility affects your critical hit chance, but also makes you more maneuverable in the air, making it easier to weave through enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More attack speed is great, but your Speed stat also improves your running, truly opening up that option of building a &quot;dashing&quot; rogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not that interested in physical abilities? No worries, mental stats are very powerful when using magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Gnome Wizard Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/6987146749aeb07b8c8157dbff88d6a6a4a975b2/header.jpg?t=1761047830","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD Athlon XE BE-2300, Snapdragon X Elite<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500 (Broadwell), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 240 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K, AMD Ryzen 5 1600, Snapdragon X Elite<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 (Pascal), AMD Radeon RX 460 (GCN 4.0)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 240 MB